Q2:Keyboard does not connect to tablet,PC,ipad?
The charging indicator will blink when is low power,which you need to charge,please make sure charged fully;
The bluetooth keyboard pairing as below steps:
1.Turn on the keyboard ,the bluetooth status indicator blinking 5s then off;
2.Press”Connect”key,Blueooth indicator blinking;
3.Open the bluetooth and search,tablet PC search the keyboard(bluetooth name:bluetooth keyboard)automatically or manual,click connection;
4.Connect successfully,the bluetooth indicator will go out;

Q3:The keyboard does not work?
the keyboard is low power condition,or the keyboard enter into auto sleep condition
If the charging indicator start blink ,means low power,you need to charge,please charge as below steps:
Step1:Connect the B port of the origin USB wire to the keyboard charging port;
Step2:Connect the A port to the power port or electric USB port;
Step3:When charging,the red light will be on until at the end of charging.
Please note that the keyboard have auto sleep function,
Keyboard will enter into sleep after idle for 30 minutes,to activate it ,press any key and wait for 3 seconds,keyboard will work;

Q4:The keyboard back light does not work?
The keyboard have not paired with the device successfully,may lead backlight does not work;
1.Press the backlight key first time is turning on the light;
2.Press second time is increasing the brightness;
3.Press third time is light off , (single color backlight);
4.Backlit key+down key/backlit key+up key to change the backlight colors(3-color backlit);
5.When the battery is less than 20%,or idle for 10 minutes,the backlight will turn off;

Q7:the mouse do not work,and not bluetooth compatible?
the mouse is low power ,or the mouse have not bluetooth paired successfully,to lead the mouse do not work .
1.we will add the mouse user manual ,include the bluetooth pair steps.
2.we will add the detail bluetooth pair steps on product description.
If the power switch at the bottom of the mouse change dim or off,you need to charge the mouse,
After 2-3 hours charging, when the charging light led is on ,the charging starts.the light goes out ,means charging fully.
Bluetooth mode
Please do mouse bluetooth pair as below steps:
Step1:switch the BT/2.4g button to bluetooth ,then automatic code match after powered;
Step2: Open device bluetooth to connect;
2.4G mode:
Step1:Switch the BT/2.4g button to 2.4G location;
Step2: plug the usb dongle into computer usb port,power on the mouse;

Please note the keyboard is ultra slim lightweight ,please take into consideration before buying.
the keyboard size is 9.84*5.91*0.2inch；
the mouse size is 4.41*2.28*0.98inch;
